cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "OMG Payment Skill — 歐買尬金流 AI 串接助手（社群維護版本）"
message: "If you use this Skill in your project, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chen
    given-names: Mitchell
    website: "https://www.mitch.tw"
    alias: "mitchellchen"
abstract: >-
  A community-maintained AI Skill (knowledge pack) that enables AI assistants
  such as Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, Cursor, Copilot, and Codex to assist developers
  in integrating Taiwan's OMG Payment (MacroWell) gateway. It includes FastAPI /
  Express / Laravel backend scaffolds, SHA256 CheckMacValue reference
  implementations with cross-language test vectors, race-safe webhook idempotency
  patterns, dual-environment dashboards (test with full-chain verification, prod
  with read-only probes), Telegram/Discord notification bots with bind/notify/menu
  parity, refund safety with warn-not-block semantics, and Taiwan legal templates
  (Terms of Service, Privacy Policy, Refund Policy). Not affiliated with OMG;
  official resources at https://github.com/omgtwhub/.
keywords:
  - omg-payment
  - omg
  - macrowell
  - taiwan-payment-gateway
  - checkmacvalue
  - webhook-idempotency
  - fastapi
